Description: Nemo extension to restore previously opened tabs
 Nemo Restore Tabs is a Nemo extension that allows users to save and
 restore previously opened tabs in the Nemo file manager. It provides
 context menu options to save current tabs, restore saved tabs, and
 clear saved tab data. The extension integrates seamlessly with Nemo
 through the python-nemo bindings.